1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,875
Dari miliaran bintang,

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:03,955
tidak satu pun berwarna hijau.

3
00:00:03,955 --> 00:00:04,844
Padahal,

4
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:07,510
cahaya Matahari paling
kuat di warna hijau!

5
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:09,922
Tapi warna lain ikut bercampur,

6
00:00:09,922 --> 00:00:11,789
jadi terlihat putih.

7
00:00:11,826 --> 00:00:12,891
Baru-baru ini,

8
00:00:12,891 --> 00:00:15,566
astronom menemukan bintang hijau pertama.

9
00:00:15,566 --> 00:00:17,058
Bintang mati ini...

10
00:00:17,058 --> 00:00:20,186
menelan puing batuan dari
sistem planetnya sendiri.

11
00:00:20,186 --> 00:00:23,389
Natriumnya menyerap cahaya
kuning sampai merah,

12
00:00:23,389 --> 00:00:24,766
menyisakan hijau.

13
00:00:24,766 --> 00:00:27,363
Mereka juga menemukan bintang merah muda.

14
00:00:27,363 --> 00:00:28,516
Kamu tim hijau,

15
00:00:28,516 --> 00:00:29,953
atau tim pink?
